        "episode_id": "ep-d8cc458a5f0049a8",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "It comes down to this: The frame for a security review is 'what could go wrong if this assumption is wrong'. We've seen this play out at teams using Sentry. If you ignore that, you end up rebuilding it from scratch a year later.",
